---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { t, type Lang } from '../../i18n/ui';

interface Props { lang: Lang }
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const isEn = lang === 'en';
---

<Base
  title={isEn ? 'My Home · After Hours' : '我的家 · After Hours'}
  description={isEn
    ? 'The house I live in, rebuilt as a 3D world you can walk into.'
    : '把自己住的房子，做成一个可以走进来的三维小世界。'}
  lang={lang}
>
  <article class="story">
    <header class="story-hero" data-fade>
      <p class="story-eyebrow">Interactive · 2026</p>
      <h1 class="story-title">{isEn ? 'My Home · After Hours' : '我的家 · After Hours'}</h1>
      <p class="story-sub">{isEn
        ? 'The house I live in, rebuilt as a 3D world you can walk into.'
        : '把自己住的房子，做成一个可以走进来的三维小世界。'}</p>
    </header>

    <div class="story-body">
      <figure class="story-figure">
        <a href="/home/" aria-label={isEn ? 'Enter the 3D house: drag to rotate, click a room to step closer' : '进入三维住宅：拖动旋转，点击房间走近一点'}>
          <img
            src="/projects/home/card.jpg"
            alt={isEn ? 'My home at night: a warm-lit 3D model of the rooms I live in' : '夜里的家：自己住宅的三维模型，房间亮着暖灯'}
            loading="eager"
          />
        </a>
      </figure>

      {isEn ? (
        <>
          <p>
            My home, rebuilt as a three-dimensional model you can actually walk around: drag to rotate the house, scroll to zoom, and click a room — the living room, the study by the window, the two bedrooms, the dining room, the kitchen, even the bathroom and the balcony — to glide over and look in. A day-and-night switch turns the lights on after hours.
          </p>
          <p>
            The house is modelled from scratch in Blender against the floor plan of the home I live in — every piece of furniture is a familiar corner, right down to the walnut bookcase and the four chairs around the dining table. The web experience is rebuilt on the open-source <a class="story-link" href="https://github.com/enderh3art/Ramen-Shop" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ramen-Shop ↗</a> by Jesse Zhou, whose credit is kept inside the page.
          </p>
          <p>
            <a class="story-link" href="/home/">Turn on the lights, come home →</a>
          </p>
        </>
      ) : (
        <>
          <p>
            把自己住的房子，做成一个可以走进来的三维小世界：拖动画面旋转房子，滚轮缩放，点一下房间——书房、客厅、两间卧室、餐厅、厨房，连浴室和阳台都在——就滑到那个空间门口往里看。右下角还能把白天切成深夜，让灯一间一间亮起来。
          </p>
          <p>
            住宅模型对照自己家的户型，在 Blender 里从零建模——每一件家具都是熟悉的角落，黑胡桃木书柜、餐桌旁的四把椅子、阳台的蛋卷桌。网页交互基于开源项目 <a class="story-link" href="https://github.com/enderh3art/Ramen-Shop" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jesse Zhou · Ramen-Shop ↗</a> 改造，页面内保留了对原作者的致谢。
          </p>
          <p>
            <a class="story-link" href="/home/">点灯，回家 →</a>
          </p>
        </>
      )}
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .story {
    padding: 0 96px 160px;
  }

  .story-hero {
    max-width: 768px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 160px 0 72px;
  }

  .story-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 22px;
    letter-spacing: -0.28px;
    color: #707070;
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
  }

  .story-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 60px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 72px;
    letter-spacing: -1.2px;
    color: #000;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .story-sub {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 60px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 72px;
    letter-spacing: -1.2px;
    color: #707070;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .story-body {
    max-width: 768px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .story-body p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 42px;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    color: #000;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .story-body p + p {
    margin-top: 1.5em;
  }

  .story-figure {
    margin: 48px 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .story-figure:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .story-figure img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    transition: opacity 200ms;
  }

  .story-figure a:hover img {
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .story-link {
    color: #000;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 6px;
    transition: color 200ms;
  }

  .story-link:hover {
    color: #707070;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .story {
      padding: 0 24px 80px;
    }

    .story-hero {
      padding: 120px 0 56px;
    }

    .story-title,
    .story-sub {
      font-size: 36px;
      line-height: 44px;
      letter-spacing: -0.72px;
    }

    .story-body p {
      font-size: 19px;
      line-height: 33px;
    }

    .story-figure {
      margin: 40px 0;
    }
  }
</style>
